---
---
<section class="plan-overview" id="plans">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">THE PLANS</div>
    <h2 class="section-title-lg">企画は2つ</h2>

    <div class="plans-grid">
      <!-- Plan 1 -->
      <div class="plan-card plan-card--multi">
        <div class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <!-- Siege weapon silhouette (catapult-like) -->
            <circle cx="12" cy="52" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="44" cy="52" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <line x1="5" y1="52" x2="51" y2="52" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="52" x2="20" y2="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="28" x2="44" y2="36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <line x1="20" y1="28" x2="10" y2="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="10" cy="13" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <line x1="40" y1="36" x2="48" y2="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-content">
          <h3 class="plan-name">Besiegeをやろう<br>大作戦</h3>
          <p class="plan-desc">毎週金曜21時から、Besiegeマルチを開催します。レギュ戦、カオス系交流マルチ、イベント、コンテストなど、その週ごとに違う遊び方で金曜を回していきます。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-arrow">
          <a href="#multi">詳細を見る →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Plan 2 -->
      <div class="plan-card plan-card--sns">
        <div class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="plan-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <!-- Camera/share icon -->
            <rect x="6" y="16" width="52" height="38" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="35" r="11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="35" r="5" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.4"/>
            <path d="M22 16 L26 8 H38 L42 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="51" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-content">
          <h3 class="plan-name">SNSジャック<br>大作戦</h3>
          <p class="plan-desc">金曜日は、時間を問わずBesiegeを投稿。スクリーンショットでも、動画でも、進捗でも、過去作でもOK。マルチに来られなくても、投稿だけで気軽に参加できます。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-arrow">
          <a href="#sns">詳細を見る →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.plan-overview {
  padding: 5rem 0;
  position: relative;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
}

.section-title-lg {
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
  color: var(--color-cream);
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

.plans-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 2rem;
}

.plan-card {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--color-bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-light);
  padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.2rem;
}

.plan-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.plan-card--multi {
  border-top: 4px solid var(--color-orange);
}

.plan-card--multi:hover { border-color: var(--color-orange); }

.plan-card--sns {
  border-top: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
}

.plan-card--sns:hover { border-color: var(--color-gold); }

.plan-num {
  position: absolute;
  top: 1rem;
  right: 1.5rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display-en);
  font-size: 4rem;
  color: var(--color-stone-light);
  line-height: 1;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.plan-icon {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
}

.plan-card--multi .plan-icon { color: var(--color-orange); }
.plan-card--sns  .plan-icon { color: var(--color-gold); }

.plan-name {
  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 1.9rem);
  color: var(--color-cream);
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.plan-desc {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  flex: 1;
}

.plan-arrow {
  margin-top: auto;
}

.plan-arrow a {
  font-family: var(--font-display-mixed);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--color-orange);
  transition: color 0.2s, letter-spacing 0.2s;
}

.plan-card--sns .plan-arrow a { color: var(--color-gold); }

.plan-arrow a:hover { letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
</style>
